  "notes": [
    "Authorization and actor identity are established by the host, not accepted from AI-authored approval fields.",
    "Demo fingerprints and IDs are illustrative, not real solver artifacts.",
    "needs_input does not record a committed idempotency result; corrected parameters use a new logical intent key to avoid ambiguity.",
    "Successful replay reports the original committed outcome without creating another transaction or revision.",
    "A capability to edit only selected elements must use property copy/reassignment when the original property is shared, or return unsupported.",
    "Normal open creates a new document namespace; fault recovery keeps the document and prior outcomes but issues a new epoch. SaveAs keeps the live document and model revision."
  ],
  "api_version": "1.0"
}
